[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    55[0m:[38;5;10m[49m | 12 | `count_occurrences` | `*text == '\0'` (empty string) | `return 0` | no — buffer always starts with `'t'` | `err_row12_count_occurrences_empty_unreachable` |
